menu "Config storage (subsys/cfg)"

    config CFG_MAX_HANDLES
        int "Maximum simultaneously open namespaces"
        default 8
        range 1 32
        help
            Size of the static handle table behind cfg_open(). One per subsystem that
            keeps a namespace open is typical. Exhaustion returns ESP_ERR_NO_MEM at
            open time (ADR-005).

    config CFG_MAX_BLOB_BYTES
        int "Maximum payload of a versioned blob (bytes)"
        default 1024
        range 16 4000
        help
            Upper bound for cfg_set_blob(). Sizes a static scratch buffer of this many
            bytes plus an 8-byte header. NVS itself limits a single blob to just under
            4000 bytes on a default page size.

endmenu
